  "releaseNotes": "'## [13.2.1](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v13.2.0...v13.2.1) (2026-09-15)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **cli:** prevent CLI assembly inspection ([#1237](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1237)) ([e25cb52](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/e25cb52dcf74a8d31f9ff27e6638f372800e2744))\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **ci:** update helm/kind-action action to v1.15.0 ([#1234](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1234)) ([e388fa0](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/e388fa0dcadab7d247fd36bf238b0b1206972c4b))\n* **core:** update dependency sonaranalyzer.csharp to 10.34.0.3385 ([#1238](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1238)) ([96c9e14](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/96c9e144c23059919d6144d12e605c95eb4be844))\n* **core:** update dependency ziggycreatures.fusioncache to 2.8.0 ([#1245](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1245)) ([29e0123](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/29e0123fad19ba8ba0181cc8aebbad18523a78b2))\n* **core:** update dotnet monorepo ([#1236](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1236)) ([8031232](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/8031232330a52bbb5d0c1ef7c7163712e8e87ba0))\n* **core:** update dotnet monorepo to 10.10.0 ([#1239](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1239)) ([2912f93](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/2912f934ad972bf8ee5b4e158d1d9782d4c56b3b))\n* **docs:** update react monorepo to v19.3.0 ([#1240](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1240)) ([907c17c](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/907c17c673506fd4cf059c99e72da8a9e972b626))\n* **test:** update dependency fluentassertions to 8.11.0 ([#1247](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1247)) ([b1f0ea3](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/b1f0ea37f81b93b57686167fdccac9014cbb9382))\n* **test:** update dependency microsoft.net.test.sdk to 18.10.0 ([#1241](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1241)) ([215a11c](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/215a11cc2ab375e9bfd74d331e6cdafa6824fc7c))\n* **test:** update dotnet monorepo ([#1235](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1235)) ([8b48866](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/8b4886623c69eba8bfc532b0c69192a42ef4177b))\n* **test:** update dotnet monorepo to 18.10.1 ([#1242](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1242)) ([94d84f5](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/94d84f519b237e91493ea26167b0ace0c85d5256))\n* **test:** update xunit-dotnet monorepo ([#1244](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1244)) ([a1123f0](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/a1123f0f39933d9535efec8eb161acdf6c1ca638))\n* **tools:** update dependency nuget-license to v4.0.17 ([#1243](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1243)) ([5be0a30](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/5be0a306563258c71e96773de5e52f2a0c4921ea))\n'",
